ots, toward Hollowdeep. Do not step off the edge."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_belfry_shaft_bottom","pos":[26.0,-12.0,9.0],"text":"The shaft's floor. The lever by the lift calls it down, and sends it up. A cold, green light comes from the east."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_belfry_loft","pos":[0.0,0.0,21.0],"text":"The Belfry Loft. The Knight guards the sluice. The lake behind you is held back by one lever."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_belfry_return","pos":[22.0,0.0,38.0],"text":"A corridor, long and dry. It runs back to the landing, to a door that opens from this side only."}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"husk","name":"husk_bell_room","patrol":[],"pos":[6.0,0.0,-38.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"husk","name":"husk_gallery_a","patrol":[],"pos":[-6.0,0.0,-24.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"husk","name":"husk_gallery_b","patrol":[],"pos":[6.0,0.0,-24.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"acolyte_bell","name":"acolyte_gallery_a","patrol":[],"pos":[-10.0,0.0,-10.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"acolyte_bell","name":"acolyte_gallery_b","patrol":[],"pos":[10.0,0.0,-10.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"husk","name":"husk_chapel","patrol":[],"pos":[-25.0,0.0,-15.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"drowned","name":"drowned_tide_w","patrol":[],"pos":[-11.0,0.0,6.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":1.5707963705062866}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"drowned","name":"drowned_tide_e","patrol":[],"pos":[11.0,0.0,12.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":-1.5707963705062866}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"acolyte_bell","name":"acolyte_tide","patrol":[],"pos":[0.0,0.0,20.5],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"choir_knight","name":"choir_knight_loft","patrol":[],"pos":[-4.0,0.0,36.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Pickup":{"codex":null,"count":1,"id":"spell_choir_litany","interact":true,"item":"spl_choir_litany","pos":[-12.0,1.0,4